<title>SOUTH KOREA: Cheiljedang buys 35,000T U.S. soybean.</title>
<headline>Cheiljedang buys 35,000T U.S. soybean.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Cheiljedang Corp bought 35,000 tonnes of U.S. No 2 soybean at basis over November futures on the Chicago Board of Trade, a company official said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The official said the company bought the soybean from Marubeni Corp for shipment in early November from the U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>Arrival was set for the western port city of Inchon.</p>
<p>The official did not give further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
